## What this track proposes

Phase 1 fixes eleven UI council findings on the Storytime week pages: the not-open 404 with a button to the highest open week, the decodable case, the song playing state, the reader page turn, the playing states and Next, the "Read the words" label, the favicon 404, and the even word gaps. Phase 2 ports option 1, Storybook Quest, with the hero fix that Daniel accepted on 2026-11-07.

## How the current system works, per this spec

The five route files under `app/[locale]/st/[level]/[week]/` render the week home, the decodable, the question screen, the reader, and the song. `loadVisibleWeek` gates a week, and the locale not-found view renders a two-language 404 from a server component with no props. The decodable renders upper-case words, the reader turns pages instantly, and the app holds no icon file.

## Round 1 findings

